===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|en|la|Troia}}, from {{der|en|grc|Τροία}}.

====Proper noun====
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|historical}} An ancient [[city]] in what is now northwestern [[Turkey]].
# A city in [[Alabama]], [[USA]], and [[county seat]] of {{l|en|Pike County}}.
# A small city in [[Kansas]], USA, and the county seat of {{l|en|Doniphan County}}.
# A city in [[Michigan]].
# A city in [[Missouri]], USA, and the county seat of {{l|en|Lincoln County}}.
# A city in [[New York]], USA, and the county seat of {{l|en|Rensselaer County}}.
# A town in [[North Carolina]], USA, and the county seat of {{l|en|Montgomery County}}.

